  "notes": "{煮|に}る is an ichidan verb meaning to boil, simmer, or stew food in liquid.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{煮|に}える→煮える：02382_nieru⟧ (intransitive, something boils/simmers)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{煮|に}る: to boil vegetables\n- ⟦{弱火|よわび}→弱火：08168_yowabi⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{煮|に}る: to simmer on low heat\n- ⟦じっくり→じっくり：06252_jikkuri⟧{煮|に}る: to simmer slowly\n- ⟦{味|あじ}→味：00826_aji⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{染|し}みる→染みる：10354_shimiru⟧⟦まで→まで：00490_made⟧{煮|に}る: to simmer until flavor soaks in\n\nRELATED COOKING TERMS:\n- ⟦{煮物|にもの}→煮物：04971_nimono⟧: simmered dish (common Japanese dish)\n- ⟦{煮込|にこ}む→煮込む：05822_nikomu⟧: to stew, simmer for a long time\n- ⟦{煮|に}つける→煮つける：27777_nitsukeru⟧: to simmer in seasoned liquid\n- ⟦{煮|に}{出|だ}す→煮出す：27776_nidasu⟧: to boil to extract (like stock)\n\nOTHER COOKING VERBS:\n- ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧: to grill, roast, bake\n- ⟦{炒|いた}める→炒める：01879_itameru⟧: to stir-fry\n- ⟦{蒸|む}す→蒸す：02307_musu⟧: to steam\n- ⟦{揚|あ}げる→揚げる：16879_ageru⟧: to deep-fry",
